孔又欲自立。子産曰：「子駟爲不可，誅之，今又效之，是亂無時息也。」於是子孔從之而相鄭簡公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002187","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"諸公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"子駟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002186","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"子駟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002186","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"諸公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"子駟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002186","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"子駟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002186","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0066","start":66,"end":71,"surface":"欲自立爲君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0072","start":72,"end":76,"surface":"公子子孔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002188","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"尉止","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002189","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"子駟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002186","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m037-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"子孔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002188","status":"contextual_provision